<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40971" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕ-līdo</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>,
				sum, 3, v. a.
			laedo, <i>to strike back</i>, <i>to strike</i> (post-class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: relisā fronte lignum
			dissilit, Prud. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφ.</span> 9, 47: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alapis relisis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Apoth. 162</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Avien. Fab.
			3</span></i>.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to refuse</i>, <i>reject</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quae firmata probant aut infirmata relidunt,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aus. Ep. 25, 42</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
